OL,3,AUS 'watching closely' after plague
OL,4,Aresearcher dies in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump says the US is
OL,7,Flooking "very strongly" at the case of
OL,8,Fa Russian lab technician who died at a
OL,9,Fplague research centre in Siberia.
OL,11,FSecretary of State Marco Rubio said
OL,12,FWashington was watching closely amid
OL,13,Fconcerns the incident could lead to the
OL,14,Fspread of pneumonic plague, but there
OL,15,Fwas no cause for alarm.
OL,17,FAnnouncing the cause of death as
OL,18,F"pneumonia of undetermined etiology",
OL,19,FIrkutsk's governor said "no
OL,20,Fmicro-organisms" linked to the woman's
OL,21,Fwork had been found "in her biological
OL,22,Fsamples".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
