OL,3,AUS 'watching closely' after plague
OL,4,Aresearcher dies in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnconfirmed reports suggested the woman
OL,7,Ffell ill either after breaking a test
OL,8,Ftube containing the pathogen or
OL,9,Ffollowing a field trip to a region
OL,10,Fwhere plague occurs naturally among
OL,11,Fwild rodents.
